---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="RevelTek | Portfolio Details"
  description="How RevelTek delivers client engagements: assess, roadmap, build, operate — representative engagement pattern with deliverables and outcomes."
  canonicalPath="/portfolio-details.html"
  ogImage="https://reveltek.com/assets/img/details/project-big-img.avif"
  header="inner"
  footer="inner"
  heroPreload="/assets/img/breadcrumb.avif">
<!--====== Breadcrumb part Start ======-->
    <section class="breadcrumb-section bg-img-c" style="background-image: url(assets/img/breadcrumb.avif);">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="breadcrumb-text">
                <h1 class="page-title">Project Details</h1>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                    <li>Project Details</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="breadcrumb-shapes">
            <div class="one"></div>
            <div class="two"></div>
            <div class="three"></div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!--====== Breadcrumb part End ======-->

    <!--====== Project Details Start ======-->
    <section class="project-details section-gap">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="project-thumb">
                <img loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1170" height="690" src="assets/img/details/project-big-img.avif" srcset="assets/img/details/project-big-img.avif 1170w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1170px" alt="Business Strategy project showcase">
            </div>

            <div class="project-content mt-60">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-8 order-2 order-lg-2">
                        <div class="content">
                            <h2>Business Strategy</h2>

                            <p class="mb-40">
                                A mid-market operator came to RevelTek with fragmented systems and no clear
                                technology roadmap. We assessed the current estate — systems, spend, and
                                delivery bottlenecks — and defined what success had to look like in measurable
                                terms: lower operating cost, faster delivery, and less operational risk.
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                From there we sequenced the work into a roadmap ordered by value, delivered the
                                highest-impact changes first alongside the client team, and stayed through
                                operation to confirm the outcomes held. Deliverables included a current-state
                                assessment, a prioritized roadmap with owners and timelines, implementation
                                support, and an operating handover with clear ownership.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-lg-4 order-1 order-lg-2">
                        <div class="details">
                            <ul>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Project Name</h3>
                                    <p>Business Strategy</p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Client</h3>
                                    <p>Representative pattern — specifics shared on request</p>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <h3>Engagement Model</h3>
                                    <p>Assess → Roadmap → Build → Operate</p>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 order-3">
                        <div class="thumbs">
                            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                                <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-6 text-center">
                                    <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="370" height="445" src="assets/img/details/project-01.avif" srcset="assets/img/details/project-01.avif 370w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 370px" alt="Business Strategy project gallery image 1">
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-6 text-center">
                                    <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="370" height="445" src="assets/img/details/project-02.avif" srcset="assets/img/details/project-02.avif 370w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 370px" alt="Business Strategy project gallery image 2">
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-6 text-center">
                                    <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="370" height="445" src="assets/img/details/project-03.avif" srcset="assets/img/details/project-03.avif 370w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 370px" alt="Business Strategy project gallery image 3">
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 order-4">
                        <div class="content">
                            <p>
                                How we delivered. <strong>Assess:</strong> current-state review across systems,
                                spend, and delivery bottlenecks. <strong>Roadmap:</strong> sequenced plan with
                                owners, timelines, and measurable outcomes. <strong>Build:</strong> highest-value
                                changes first, shipped with your team, not around them. <strong>Operate:</strong>
                                handover with runbooks and steady-state support so results hold. This page
                                describes a representative engagement pattern — scope and outcomes vary by
                                client. Contact us to discuss what applies to your situation.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!--====== Project Details End ======-->

    <!--====== CTA Start ======-->
    <section class="cta-aection">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="cta-wrap bg-img-c" style="background-image: url(assets/img/lines/16.avif);">
                <div class="row justify-content-center">
                    <div class="col-lg-8">
                        <div class="cta-content text-center">
                            <div class="section-title both-border mb-30">
                                <span class="title-tag">Start A Conversation</span>
                                <h2 class="title">Have A Similar Challenge? Get A Clear Roadmap And An Honest Estimate</h2>
                            </div>
                            <a href="contact.html" class="main-btn main-btn-3">Contact Us</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!--====== CTA Start ======-->

    <!--====== Client Area Start ======-->
    <section class="client-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="client-slider section-gap line-top">
                <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-between" id="clientSlider">
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="162" height="90" src="assets/img/clients/01.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/01.avif 162w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 162px" alt="Client logo 1">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="193" height="85" src="assets/img/clients/02.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/02.avif 193w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 193px" alt="Client logo 2">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="117" height="95" src="assets/img/clients/03.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/03.avif 117w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 117px" alt="Client logo 3">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="164" height="93" src="assets/img/clients/04.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/04.avif 164w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 164px" alt="Client logo 4">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="104" height="96" src="assets/img/clients/05.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/05.avif 104w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 104px" alt="Client logo 5">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="162" height="90" src="assets/img/clients/01.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/01.avif 162w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 162px" alt="Client logo 1">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="193" height="85" src="assets/img/clients/02.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/02.avif 193w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 193px" alt="Client logo 2">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="117" height="95" src="assets/img/clients/03.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/03.avif 117w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 117px" alt="Client logo 3">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="164" height="93" src="assets/img/clients/04.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/04.avif 164w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 164px" alt="Client logo 4">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col">
                        <a href="#" class="client-img d-block text-center">
                            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="104" height="96" src="assets/img/clients/05.avif" srcset="assets/img/clients/05.avif 104w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 104px" alt="Client logo 5">
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <!--====== Client Area End ======-->
</BaseLayout>
